Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.32,0:01:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll lose my dreams. I'm a stage that's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fly on my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were still in the desert\Ntrying to avoid Etemon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his dark network when\Na big ship pulled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got on board and everything\Nwas fine, at least we thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it turned out, the ship was\Njust a trap set up by Cockatrimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used his petrifier and\Nturned some of us to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.88,0:01:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, nothing\Nbeats a good Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sent Cockatrimon flying and a\Nwell-placed cactus took care of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next quest turned out to be for Mimi,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it was then that she realized how\Nimportant she was to our adventure.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:15.03,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Fairy, Piccolomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I admit a little breeze would be\Nnice, but it's still a beautiful day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe for a scorpion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful, isn't it, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.16,0:02:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And every crest we've found\Nso far has been different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we need to\Nlearn how to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or else our Digimon could\Ndigivolve all messed up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.02,0:02:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but none of that really\Nmatters until we find all the crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I think you're probably\Nright about that one, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the crest power\Ncomes from having them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what are they doing back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we gotta move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna take some downtime,\Nwe need to find some shade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.02,0:02:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were right in the\Nmiddle of a serious ninja
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,conversation about the\Ncrescent and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then you made me\Nforget what I was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be in charge of finding the shade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll catch up. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something grabbed them from underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Guagamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the same one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.10,0:03:34.10,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Kuwagamon
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.10,0:03:34.10,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.10,0:03:34.10,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Insect Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.10,0:03:34.10,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.10,0:03:34.10,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.10,0:03:34.10,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.10,0:03:34.10,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Scissor Arms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gokimon, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking that ugly face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's sure bigger than\Nhe was the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, we have a big problem.\NThis guy's much stronger than
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.32,0:03:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he used to be oh no now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve! All
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.82,0:03:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right all right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:04:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rethinking our training\Nprogram here oh man i hope
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,agumon doesn't freak What if\Nsomething's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I can't become Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, stay away from his choppers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, move, Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move, move, do something! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.34,0:04:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pixie Bomb! Seek and Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out. Are you two okay? Are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you okay what just happened to us
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a powder puff with wings\Njust don't use it on your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,face and where's Gokimon\Noh man maybe that's him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am no enemy. Nope, nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:04:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, you are your own enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the famous Piximon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.20,0:05:11.66,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Piccolomon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.20,0:05:11.66,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.20,0:05:11.66,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Fairy Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.20,0:05:11.66,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.20,0:05:11.66,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.20,0:05:11.66,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.20,0:05:11.66,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Bit Bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.44,0:05:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piximon is famous in the Digital\NWorld for his skills and training,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but few have ever met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His secret home is the training ground\Nfor all the great Digimon fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've heard all about you, too,\Nbut so far I am not impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seven are supposed\Nto be the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better be more careful,\Nor you'll end up digi-dinners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without my spears and my magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gokimon would be eating you\Nwith a side of digi-fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You digimon there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to protect the children,\Nbut half the time they're protecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see some guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see some courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy reminds me of a gym\Nteacher I once had. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just don't have any guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't we get points for enthusiasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the news isn't all bad. Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, you're all\Ngoing to train with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:05:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not go overboard, Piximon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially you two guys. Me? You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two need lots of help,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I have a special extreme\Ntraining program just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hear him right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds kind of extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we trust a ping-pong ball with wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he did save Agumon and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he do that if he was no good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.49,0:06:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't have a black\Ngear anywhere on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.85,0:06:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Biyomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you seem to\Nknow a lot about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's an honor to be\Nchosen for training by Piximon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a lot of work to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could use some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because we've nearly\Nbeen eaten a hundred times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there are worse options.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, do we have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All in favor, say aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you all just hurry up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little further.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about the seventh\Ntime he's said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ask a cactus for directions?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:06:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cold rupees. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pixie portal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a hole in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one who thinks\Nthis looks like trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's just my front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on in now, quickly, before it closes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.18,0:07:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool, a jungle inside a desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you got lots of friends\Nwho want to play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have seen\Nit when I first got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind us, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.78,0:07:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's Edelon and his trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And right outside the\Nfront door he is, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He isn't able to see through the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sees nothing but desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stupid screen is still broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.28,0:08:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've almost got it fixed, Edermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need for a conniption fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll show you conniption,\Nyou insolent little worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fix it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a show to get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody, home we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My house is just up these steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to walk a fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I didn't bring my\Nstair-climbing sneakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I just remembered\NI'm afraid of heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Purely from a logical standpoint,\Nit doesn't look very safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this part of our training?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, no sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just fly up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And before you know it, I'll be chilling\Nby the pool while you guys are still...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did I mention there will be no flying\Nby anyone during all my training?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.18,0:08:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you rookies learned that\Nthe easy way is sometimes a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Piximon never heard of elevators.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're all tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, you've almost arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's his place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, and there's\Nplenty of food for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it as handsome as I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said something about food?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, but first you must earn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known there'd be a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you all to scrub the floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not you, Agumon and Tai. Come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a special chore for you. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We probably have to paint the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last time I scrubbed\Na floor was never.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a simple task, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even you'll catch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really training, or is this\Njust Pixiemon's maid's day off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he doesn't like to vacuum?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, let's have a cleaning race.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.38,0:10:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, set, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brum, brum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.62,0:10:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on into the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's pitch black in here What\Nkind of a chore can we do in here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we won't be able to see\Nour hands in front of our faces
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your training
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must find your way back
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What delicious food Mine all mine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai and Agumon never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.39,0:10:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they glow, it means\Nthe crests are nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is a good idea, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, maybe we should\Nbring Tanemon and Goblin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crests must be inside\Nthe barrier, so we're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Izzy, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, where are we? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were in a cave, but I\Ndon't remember any boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know not to stand up in a boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, grab this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look at the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't rock the boat, Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now look what you did we're both in the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,water what i did you\Nwere the one standing up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the boat i was just\Ntrying to pull you've
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been watching what you were doing instead
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of looking at some stupid light in the\Ndistance you hadn't pulled on the oar we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't be swimming\Nlike i do not swim like
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a tuna fish and where\Ndo you get off blaming
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gokimon, do you know where Izzy went?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not in his bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't find Matt. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you send my brother somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brother and his pal left to\Nlook for crests about midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would Izzy leave me behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First it's Agumon and Tai leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's Matt and Izzy gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since we met Piximon,\Npeople started disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe next, Joe, we'll turn up missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.43,0:13:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if it's Piximon\Nmaking everyone disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joe, chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can trust Piximon, can't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you wouldn't do\Nanything really cool, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like not feed us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Training will now begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to find a crest, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's mostly just\Nbecause of Kabuterimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to see what stage he\Nwill digivolve into after that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the reason why\Nyou're looking for a crest?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.63,0:13:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to use the crest\Nto digivolve me. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not into a Digimon, but to\Nmake me stronger and smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe learn something new about myself,\Nyou know, to reach my next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The barrier of this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me we came\Nall this way for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, look at that glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it! The crests!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crests have got to be\Nright there inside the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:13:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's outside the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but we're so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope my hand doesn't melt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can go through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.74,0:14:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light's bright down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we should try holding\Nour tags up towards the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, man, this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both found our crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meramon, we have contact\Nin sector G3, sir. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the sector\Nwe just passed through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn us around, turn us around,\Nyou little whippersnapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:14:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send him at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love a roadie with a good appetite.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.88,0:15:16.85,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Tyranomon
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.88,0:15:16.85,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.88,0:15:16.85,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Dinosaur Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.88,0:15:16.85,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.88,0:15:16.85,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.88,0:15:16.85,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.88,0:15:16.85,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Fire Breath
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tyranomon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a huge Digimon with fire breath strong\Nenough to cook a couple of boys like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making funny faces will\Nnot defeat your enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.32,0:15:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must always...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.34,0:15:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My barrier has been broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Izzy's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be in trouble! And Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I see this guy\Nin one of my nightmares?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd be more\Ncareful what you'd dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, Izzy, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you're safe. Hey, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well, isn't that nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody's all together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I can't resist an\Naudience, so I guess it's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's this song I call\N"Bye-Bye, Digimon, Bye-Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My power's been drained.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It zapped them, so now\Nthey can't digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.74,0:16:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more we fight it, the\Nfarther away we drift.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember this bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.03,0:17:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? That's you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.14,0:17:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai! Ugly man! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends have been in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to come back\Nbefore it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna learn how to\Nride my bike. Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't call it quits now just\Nbecause of one or two mistakes you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I've made plenty,\Nand I ought to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just have to get up\Nand try again. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.60,0:17:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can hold you up from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See? You're doing it. You're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm doing it all\Nby myself. I'm riding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.60,0:18:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Agumon, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all about overcoming your fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so afraid of you digivolving\Nback into Skull Greymon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, that I lost it. You must\Nbe a mind reader. That same fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stopped me from digivolving\Nto Greymon But if we really
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in ourselves. It'll be\Njust like riding a bike, Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my friend, I'm coming back to you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on our way back. Right, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're in real trouble. Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for Tai any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs this lesson,\Nbut I've got to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.90,0:19:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, he digivolved!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.68,0:19:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made it! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma's pulling the cables out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, Grandma! Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the black cables\Nall shattering into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they cut it kind of\Nclose, but they did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.06,0:20:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those brats made me mad and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta find something easier to beat\Nlike some cardboard boxes or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.24,0:20:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Piximon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've learned a lot from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like how to scrub floors\Nand starve half to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.59,0:20:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just Joe's stomach talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Far from over your training is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, life itself\Nis a training session.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learn all you can. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They truly are the Digi-Destiny. Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt have I, for though\Nthey are sometimes foolish,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have seen the love in their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a little luck, they just may\Nsucceed and save our digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. How are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I see my eyes, I'll\Nremind you of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.30,0:22:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day, that time, I'll see a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.86,0:22:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I see the wind, I'll see the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we're going to go\Nthrough the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.72,0:22:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to start\Nthe fight with Etemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.82,0:22:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, Digimon Adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.34,0:22:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of NANOMON.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.16,0:23:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're going to move on.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.02,0:23:04.94,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Nanomon of the Labyrinth!

